        "title": "[2607.25021] Chart-Supported or Model-Supplied? Examining MLLM-Generated Claims for Accessible Visualization",
        "description": "Abstract page for arXiv paper 2607.25021: Chart-Supported or Model-Supplied? Examining MLLM-Generated Claims for Accessible Visualization",
        "keywords": null,
